      "content": "i mean i could go to the doctor but it's a lot of money and i'm pretty sure i'm just dehydrated from the supplement's ingredients. do u think i can just drink a ton of Gatorade or something and wait it out? i dont want to make a big deal out of it if its just a minor side effect.",
