      "content": "idk i feels like i'm just overreacting. i checked my sugar right before i messaged u and it was okay-ish, like 180 or something. it's not even that high right?? i feel like i can just power through this with some electrolytes and more water. u think i should just stay home and monitor it for a few more days instead of wasting money on an urgent care visit?",
